WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.660
[MUSIC - Orchestra warming up]

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:10.020
When people think of the extraordinary breakthroughs
that are made in cancer research, they don’t

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:14.230
realize the harmony that takes place behind
that research.

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:20.070
In music, this only happens when notes work
together, build off each other, and combine

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:23.860
to create the perfect harmony.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:29.630
In cancer research, data pieced together in
a specific way can lead to new discoveries

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:32.149
and treatments for cancer.

00:00:32.149 --> 00:00:39.980
Now, thanks to the NCI Cancer Research Data
Commons, or CRDC, sharing data is becoming

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:43.430
more harmonious than ever before.

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:58.360
CRDC is hitting the right notes.... providing
access to many types of data: genomic, proteomic,

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:05.780
imaging, clinical trial, and more.

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:07.360
All in one place.

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:13.850
It is enhancing the way data are shared, through
a single cloud-based and expandable infrastructure.

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:19.860
One that empowers researchers to perform at
peak by working in real-time to explore and

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:24.330
analyze data, without the downtime of downloading.

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:29.470
And equips them with the computational power
that only comes with the cloud.

00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:37.250
CRDC increases connectivity, allowing researchers
access to standardized and harmonized data.

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:43.600
To ask more complex research questions by
combining diverse data types across the CRDC,

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:49.490
or with their own, for integrative analysis
to increase our knowledge about cancer.

00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:53.380
All further supporting the goals of precision
medicine.

00:01:53.380 --> 00:02:00.020
All furthering the effort to accelerate biomedical
discoveries, without missing a beat.

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:07.270
The CRDC gives researchers a place where they
can work in concert, in sync, and in harmony.

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:12.120
Now that’s music to many people's ears.

